            "review_title": "Review at Mama's Bakery",
            "review_text": "AppleAdam\nSanibel Island, Florida341 contributions\n0\nTasteless pastries\nSep 2024 • Solo\nWhat utter rubbish! \n\nThey look like cakes, and even the blueberry cheesecake ‘looks’ like cheesecake - zero taste! \nExactly the same for the ‘Apple cream pie’ - not even any cream. \nThe chocolate look-a-like chocolate contained zero chocolate. \n\nVietnamese call this nonsense ‘Lam mau” = colour. All colour and nowt else!\nRead more\nWritten September 28, 2024",
